432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 243 0 R
/E (During the development of the Campus Lost & Found Item Matching System, several challenges were encountered. Managing and organizing lost and found records was addressed using Cloud Firestore. Secure user registration and login were implemented using Firebase Authentication. Another challenge was comparing lost and found items, which was handled using a weighted matching algorithm based on item name, description, category, location, and date. Handling item images was improved by adding image selection and preview functionality. Input validation and error handling were also implemented to prevent incomplete submissions and manage database or network failures.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
